## Model card

- **Name:** Codestral 25.08
- **Short description:** Mistral AI's July 2025 update to Codestral, a specialized low-latency code model optimized for IDE autocomplete, fill-in-the-middle (FIM), and code generation/completion workflows.
- **Provider / access:** Mistral AI La Plateforme / API (model id `codestral-2508` per Mistral docs) and partner gateways (e.g. OpenRouter/OpenCode listings). Supports chat completions and FIM endpoints per Mistral model documentation.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced July 30, 2025 (Mistral blog/docs); knowledge cutoff not stated in verified public sources reviewed.
- **IDs:** `codestral-2508` (Mistral API), local folder mapped as `opencode/codestral-25.08` in this repo context.
- **Context window:** 128K context shown on Mistral model page; local meta notes 256,000 total / 8,192 max output in this environment's listing. Exact limits may vary by endpoint/provider.
- **Modalities:** Text and code in; text and code out (chat, structured outputs/function calling/prefix/predicted outputs/batching/FIM as listed by Mistral docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.30 / $0.90 per 1M input/output tokens on Mistral La Plateforme (per Mistral model page/docs).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/specialized code model; parameter count not publicly disclosed on reviewed pages.

